+    // [bar1DmaFbBase[i], bar1DmaFbBase[i] + bar1DmaSize[i]) and maps it to
+    // bar1DmaAddress[i], so the peer address of an FB physical address pa is
+    //     bar1DmaAddress[i] + (pa - bar1DmaFbBase[i])
